</Positioned>
<Positioned left="1156" top="404">
<Container width="356" height="146" alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="23" color="#132D2C" textAlign="LEFT" fontStyle="NORMAL" softWrap="true">夜间降温不足，可能让热压力持续。HeatRisk 会考虑异常热度持续时间与夜间低温。</Text></Container>
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="60" top="756">
